{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t紀念中國工農紅軍長征勝利90周年大會，上午在北京舉行。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n央視報道，中共中央總書記、國家主席、中央軍委主席習近平出席大會，並發表重要講話。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n中共中央政治局常委李強、趙樂際、王滬寧、蔡奇、丁薛祥、李希及國家副主席韓正出席大會。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T03:02:40.261193+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:14:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T20:18:30.634651+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T02:58:03.659087+00:00","content_hash":"3ebc9d3ca139d7f6d1a5b427b2be9fb307cdd831e245d7970973ebc9a9a7dbd3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}